Package: PhenotypeTemplates
Type: Package
Title: Generate Phenotype Cohort Definitions from Clinical Context
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-11-19
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jamie", "Gilbert", email = "gilbert@ohdsi.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Observational Health Data Science and Informatics", role = c("cph"))
    )
Maintainer: Jamie Gilbert <gilbert@ohdsi.org>
Description: Generates a set of OHDSI cohort definitions for a phenotype from
    concept sets grouped by clinical role (disease of interest, hypernyms,
    symptoms, diagnostics, treatments, complications, alternative diagnoses
    and etiology) and a structured clinical context (clinical course, care
    setting and expected evidence). Variants are crossed on evidence
    strictness, index specificity, hospitalization and exclusion of
    alternative diagnoses, producing a cohort definition set suitable for
    'CohortGenerator' and phenotype evaluation.
